<match> - Optional search parameter}
{if:{get:end}|=|false|then:{evalsilent:{replace:(?<!\\)"list(?<!\\)",(?<!\\)"(?<match>.*?)(?<!\\)"(.*)|with:{ignore:
    {set:match|true}
